WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.784
You've completed the Space Center.

2
00:00:01.784 --> 00:00:08.919
What matters moving forward: IP is territorial, file your U.S. trademark with the USPTO before you launch in the market.

3
00:00:08.919 --> 00:00:14.984
General liability insurance is the baseline, many clients and landlords require proof before they'll work with you.

4
00:00:14.984 --> 00:00:21.762
Use free resources and referrals to get oriented, then engage a qualified attorney for decisions that carry legal risk.

5
00:00:21.762 --> 00:00:26.400
When you're ready, head back to your dashboard and pick your next destination.
